  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Ireland Dairy Project, Implemented by Teagasc (Lead), SFSI, Greenfield International, Kenya Agricultural Research Organization &#x2013; Naivasha and Self Help Africa. Project seeks to contribute to knowledge and on-farm practice around innovative climate smart and economic production systems through the introduction of forage-based animal genetics and the use of novel climate smart forage feeding systems on-farm.  Activities : Development of Economic Breeding Index, Improved forage based  development of new improved systems of production to meet 90%+ of the animal&#x2019;s dietary requirements , Innovation Hub in support of the dairy forage-based production technology through existing extension networks and routes to lead farmers via external Innovation Nodes. Target Group: 2000 Male and female Small Holder farmers</narrative>
  </description>
